<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="description" content="Remplacer chauffage gaz par PAC à Melun 77 : économisez 60-80€/mois. Aides 10 800€, reste charge 2500€. Devis RGE gratuit.">
<meta name="robots" content="index, follow">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://www.maprimeadapt-idf.fr/remplacer-gaz-pac-melun-77">
<title>Remplacer gaz par PAC à Melun 77 : économisez 60-80€/mois, aides 10 800€</title>
<style>
* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0f4f8 0%, #e8eef7 100%); color: #2c3e50; line-height: 1.6; }
.container { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px; }
.hero { background: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 50px 40px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin-bottom: 40px; }
.hero h1 { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; color: #1a3d2b; margin-bottom: 15px; }
.hero p { font-size: 16px; color: #555; margin-bottom: 20px; }
.section { background: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 40px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin-bottom: 30px; }
.section h2 { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: #1a3d2b; margin-bottom: 20px; border-bottom: 2px solid #f0f4f8; padding-bottom: 15px; }
.calc-box { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d4f1e4, #e8f5f0); border: 2px solid #1a3d2b; border-radius: 12px; padding: 30px; text-align: center; margin: 20px 0; }
.calc-box .amount { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; color: #1a3d2b; margin: 10px 0; }
.table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 20px 0; }
.table th, .table td { padding: 12px; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0; }
.table th { background: #f5f9f7; font-weight: 600; color: #1a3d2b; }
.form { background: #1a3d2b; color: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 40px; margin-top: 40px; }
.form h2 { color: white; margin-bottom: 20px; }
.form-group { margin-bottom: 15px; }
.form-group label { display: block; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 6px; }
.form-group input, .form-group textarea { width: 100%; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3); border-radius: 6px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); color: white; }
.btn-submit { width: 100%; padding: 12px; background: white; color: #1a3d2b; border: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; }
</style>
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "LocalBusiness",
  "name": "Mon Projet Habitat - Melun (Gaz→PAC)",
  "telephone": "06 04 43 34 20",
  "address": { "@type": "PostalAddress", "addressLocality": "Melun", "postalCode": "77000", "addressCountry": "FR" },
  "areaServed": { "@type": "City", "name": "Melun" }
}
</script>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
  <div class="hero">
    <h1>Remplacer chauffage gaz par PAC à Melun 77 : économisez 60-80€/mois</h1>
    <p><strong>Maison chauffée au gaz à Melun (77) ?</strong> PAC air-eau coûte 12-14k€ TTC → aides 10 800€ déduites → reste 2500€ seulement. Économies : 60-80€/mois = 720-960€/an. Amortissement 3-4 ans. Artisans RGE locaux.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>Gaz vs PAC à Melun 77 : calcul réel</h2>
    <div class="calc-box">
      <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #666; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px;">Facture chauffage actuelle (gaz)</div>
      <div class="amount">190€/mois</div>
    </div>
    <div class="calc-box">
      <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #666; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px;">Facture avec PAC air-eau</div>
      <div class="amount">125€/mois</div>
      <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-top: 10px;">PAC (75€) + Éco-PTZ mensuel (50€)</div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: center; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #28a745; margin-top: 30px;">
      Vous économisez 65 €/mois
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>Coûts Melun 77 (maison 100 m² au gaz)</h2>
    <table class="table">
      <tr>
        <th>Élément</th>
        <th>Situation actuelle (gaz)</th>
        <th>Avec PAC</th>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Consommation chauffage</strong></td>
        <td>18 000 kWh/an</td>
        <td>7 000 kWh électricité (COP 2.8)</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Coût mensuel</strong></td>
        <td><strong>190€</strong></td>
        <td><strong>125€</strong> (75€ PAC + 50€ Éco-PTZ)</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Économie/an</strong></td>
        <td>—</td>
        <td><strong style="color: #28a745;">+ 780€</strong></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>Aides MaPrimeRénov' + CEE Melun (77)</h2>
    <p><strong>Aides cumulées :</strong> MaPrimeRénov' 5000€ + CEE 9000€ + TVA 5.5% (~1500€) = 10 800€ total. <strong>Reste à charge : 2500€ seulement</strong> (ou 45€/mois Éco-PTZ 0% pendant 20 ans).</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>Artisans RGE à Melun 77</h2>
    <p>Vérifiez <strong>france-renov.gouv.fr</strong> : nom artisan + PAC domain. Évitez devis sans visite site, sans garantie écrite, sans aides détaillées. <strong>Bon prix : 10 500-14 000€ TTC</strong> (matériel + pose). Plus cher = probable arnaque (accessoires gonflés, main-d'œuvre excessive).</p>
  </div>

  <div class="form">
    <h2>Devis PAC gratuit Melun 77 (24h)</h2>
    <form onsubmit="submitForm(event)">
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Nom complet *</label>
        <input type="text" name="nom" required>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Téléphone *</label>
        <input type="tel" name="tel" placeholder="06 XX XX XX XX" required>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Type radiateurs (alu, fonte, tuyauterie)</label>
        <input type="text" name="radiateurs" placeholder="Alu 15 radiateurs...">
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="btn-submit">Recevoir devis Melun (gaz→PAC)</button>
    </form>
    <p style="margin-top: 15px; font-size: 13px;">WhatsApp : <strong>06 04 43 34 20</strong></p>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
function submitForm(e) {
  e.preventDefault();
  const data = {
    nom: e.target.nom.value,
    tel: e.target.tel.value,
    radiateurs: e.target.radiateurs.value,
    source: 'remplacer-gaz-pac-melun-77',
    commune: 'Melun',
    chauffage_actuel: 'gaz'
  };
  fetch('/api/lead', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify(data) })
    .then(r => r.json())
    .then(r => { if(r.ok) { alert('Devis Melun en 24-48h\n06 04 43 34 20'); e.target.reset(); } });
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
